**Key translation decisions:**

| Java | C++ | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `List<Student>` | `std::vector<Student>` | Ordered collection, same semantics |
| `Map<String, List<String>>` | `std::unordered_map<std::string, std::vector<std::string>>` | `HashMap` → `unordered_map` |
