| Java | C++ | Rationale |
|------|-----|-----------|
| `Double` (nullable) | `std::optional<double>` | Direct equivalent for nullable value types |
| `int[]` | `std::vector<int>` | Standard dynamic array |
| `double[]` (nullable) | `std::optional<std::vector<double>>` | Nullable array |
